flavor/deathtrap-2011-10-25","license":null,"text":"\"Deathtrap\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 25 Oct 2011. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-deathtrap-2011-10-25-e13","era":null,"summary":"Master Bey appears, lets Kasten through, and announces they leave for Thraben in an hour.","participants":["master-bey","nadia-bey","kasten","jorgson"],"location":"bey-manor","importance":"minor","page":"archive/savor-flavor-deathtrap-2011-10-25","order":319,"story_date":"2011-10-25","storyline":"Innistrad","source":"wizards-archive","paragraph":29,"quote":"\"A messenger from Thraben arrived,\" he told her. \"There's a situation in Thraben. We leave in an hour.\"","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150226212135/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/deathtrap-2011-10-25#:~:text=%22A%20messenger%20from%20Thraben,leave%20in%20an%20hour.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards-archive","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Deathtrap","series":"Savor the Flavor","authors":[],"date":"2011-10-25","url":"http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/deathtrap-2011-10-25","link":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150226212135/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/deathtrap-2011-10-25#:~:text=%22A%20messenger%20from%20Thraben,leave%20in%20an%20hour.%22","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150226212135/http://magic.wizards.com:80/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/deathtrap-2011-10-25","license":null,"text":"\"Deathtrap\". Savor the Flavor, Wizards of the Coast, 25 Oct 2011. Archived by the Internet Archive."}},{"id":"savor-flavor-deathtrap-2011-10-25-e14","era":null,"summary":"Master Bey tells Nadia she did well; she goes to bury the dead.","participants":["master-bey","nadia-bey","kasten"],"location":"bey-manor","importance":"minor","page":"archive/savor-flavor-deathtrap-2011-10-25","order":319,"story_date":"2011-10-25","storyline":"Innistrad","source":"wizards-archive","parag